"color:#6F42C1\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          onOpenChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{setOpen}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          onOk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          删除明细</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Popconfirm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"outline\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"neutral\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> setOpen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          重新打开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>气泡由 Portal 在客户端挂载，服务端只输出触发按钮静态骨架。&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
